# Purpose
Helps users choose export formats and check files before exporting PDFs,
spreadsheets, documents, and named deliverables.

# Key Sections
- Choose the right format.
- Before exporting.
- PDF exports.
- Spreadsheet exports.
- Document exports.
- File names.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Exported files may lose formulas, comments, hidden metadata, or editability.

